cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MANFIZ in research, please cite this software and the associated MANFIZ publication when available."
type: software
title: "MANFIZ: Multi-Output Adaptive Neuro-Fuzzy Inference with Zonotopic Consequents for Deterministic Set-Based Uncertainty Estimation"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Pérez-Pérez"
    given-names: "Esvan-Jesús"
repository-code: "https://github.com/esvandejesus/MANFIZ"
url: "https://github.com/esvandejesus/MANFIZ"
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
abstract: "Native Python toolbox for shared-premise multi-output neuro-fuzzy system identification with zonotopic consequents, common-parameter feasibility calibration, adaptive outer reduction, bounded regressor-noise propagation, causal free-run prediction, and reproducible interval-coverage verification."
keywords:
  - neuro-fuzzy identification
  - zonotopes
  - set-membership estimation
  - multi-output systems
  - interval prediction
  - uncertainty propagation
  - system identification
